     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Habits and events",
     "texto": [
      "The imperfect describes past habits and situations: **Mergeam des la bunici** (\"I often went to my grandparents'\"). A one-off event can appear in the compound past: **Într-o zi, am găsit o broască țestoasă** (\"One day, I found a tortoise\")."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
